OpenUSD
-------

Parts of this repository are derived from OpenUSD (Universal Scene
Description, https://github.com/PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD), release
v26.08, and rewritten in Rust: the data model, the usda, usdc and usdz file
formats, and composition (src/usd/sdf, src/usd/text, src/usd/crate_file,
src/usd/compose, src/usd/package/mod.rs, src/usd/package/zip.rs,
src/usd/layer_file.rs, src/usd/scene/values.rs and src/usd/scene/xform.rs).
Each such file says so in its first lines. They are licensed under the
Tomorrow Open Source Technology License 1.0
(licenses/OPENUSD-TOST-1.0.txt): the Apache License 2.0 with a different
Section 6 ("Trademarks"), which grants no permission to use Pixar's trade
names, trademarks or product names. No OpenUSD code is linked or vendored.

OpenUSD's NOTICE reads:

